    "media:imagetext": "ComAi\nEMBRAER EMB-110P1 BANDEIRANTE\nEMERGENCY PROCEDURES\n(PLEASE DO NOT REMOVE THIS CARD FROM AIRCRAFT)\nLOCATION AND USE OF FLOTATION DEVICE\nWHAT TO DO IN CASE OF AN EMERGENCY LANDING\nRemain calm and follow instructions of crew. Sit well back\nin seat - pull seat belt tight - assume appropriate position in\nillustration until plane stops. When airplane is completely\nstopped, unfasten seat belt and follow instructions of crew.\nAIR STAIR DOOR (I\n1. PRESS LOCK\n2. PULL HANDLE\n3. PUSH DOOR\nFire Extinguisher\nFirst Aid Kit\nEmergency\nExits\nFRONT EMERGENCY EXIT(B)\nIN EMERGENCY\n1. PULL RING AND REMOVE COVER\n2. LIFT HANDLE AND PUSH DOOR\n3. PULL SAFETY LATCH RING DOWN\nOVERWING EMERGENCY EXITS (C)\nEMERGENCY EXIT\n1. TEAR OFF COVER\n2. PULL HANDLE\n3. PUSH DOOR\n2.\n1 2.\nA Fire Extinguisher\n• First Aid Kit\n(FORM FO-0122 REV. 3/87)",
